      <p class="brunch__text">
        <span class="brunch__lead">{en ? "One evening, one chef" : "Un soir, un chef"}</span>
        {en
          ? <Fragment> : a concept created by Chouchou in 2024 — one guest chef each month, for a unique moment to share. Eric Boschman, Curtis Mulpas, Pierre Burtonboy, Dario Michaud, Kévin Roquet, Carlo de Pascale, Sébastien Hayot… who's next?</Fragment>
